# jdk.m3.graphics: sources absorbed from HumbleUI Skija 0.143.18 (make/m3/tooling/skija-absorb). javac -Xlint:all on the
# module reports only these four kinds: 56 missing-explicit-ctor, 4 this-escape, 2 fallthrough (intended, in
# M3ColorType and M3SVGLengthContext), and 1 module (the "m3" component of the module name).

DISABLED_WARNINGS_java += missing-explicit-ctor this-escape fallthrough module

# Doclint as java.base and jdk.compiler run it (-Xdoclint:all/protected) without the "missing" group: the absorbed
# Javadoc is the donor's and leaves members undocumented. make/m3/tooling/skija-absorb/tools/absorb_leaf1.sh (gate G4b)
# compiles the module with these flags, the lint kinds above and -Werror: 0 errors, 0 warnings.
DOCLINT += -Xdoclint:all/protected,-missing
